  "coverage": [
    "Actual PT/EN/FR/ES/DE selector: live card at320/390/1440 and nine additional scenarios at320,60 locale checks. Static card and generated section titles, accessible label, raw identities, AT/work/insurance/inspection/safety statuses and metadata verified.",
    "Real isolated SQL fixtures produce valid, expired insurance, pending inspection, provisional work without AT, missing work and restored states. Closing fixture guides or changing fixture due dates/statuses occurs explicitly between locale matrices; production classifiers and dates are unchanged.",
    "503 work endpoint retains the original cached work confirmation timestamp; mixed source, genuine offline cached reload, exact malformed document bytes and cache recovery tested. Unavailable vehicle retains its input ID and day fallback without invented identity.",
    "Same-number REGULAR/EXTRA have distinct pool/type and separate notes. Offline EXTRA selection preserves the original REGULAR draft. Session switch followed by the original guarded refresh callback performs no HTTP and retains old source bytes.",
    "Every locale matrix preserves crew nodes and refresh handler, focus, operational inputs, status classes, source markers/timestamps, field storage, full outbox and SQL rows. Instrumented document/reminder/photo/route producers do not rerun on locale changes. Only expected language-preference PUTs occur during matrices; user-alias language metadata changes intentionally, while identity and both tokens remain invariant.",
    "No page errors or POST/PATCH/DELETE requests. Existing one-second session guard stays active; only periodic15/30/60s timers disabled by fixture. Scenario110s, locators9s and runner120s remain unchanged.",
    "Original document recovery, document summary UI, visit feedback and field browser integration tests also pass. Node syntax and complete unit/technician commands run on this product version.",
    "Card/tile width assertions retained for every matrix. German320px overflow was reproduced and diagnosed as the refresh button, fixed only with crew-head flex-wrap. Before/after live and blocked screenshots reviewed; button and text wrap without truncation. Existing toast/navigation outside the card remain outside this translation scope."
  ],
